```
$ gen-circleci-orb update -h
Re-sync an existing repo's orb-managed CI wiring to the current flow

Usage: gen-circleci-orb update [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --config <CONFIG>  Path to gen-circleci-orb.toml [default: gen-circleci-orb.toml]
      --ci-dir <CI_DIR>  Path to the .circleci/ directory [default: .circleci]
      --check            Verify mode: write nothing and exit non-zero (with a diff and guidance) when the CI wiring is out of date. For use in CI
  -h, --help             Print help (see more with '--help')

```
